# Toph, the First Metalbender: "Nontoken artifacts you control are lands in addition to their other types." Bot1's four Moxen are
# artifact lands once Toph is on the battlefield (they keep Artifact: CR 205.1b "in addition"). Bot1's Clue token (from Thraben
# Inspector) is an artifact but a token, so it is no land; Bot2's Mox Jet is a nontoken artifact but not under Bot1's control, so
# it is no land either. At Bot1's end step Toph earthbends 2 (a land it controls: a Mox, there being nothing else): the Mox is then
# a 2/2 haste artifact land creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Toph, the First Metalbender
Thraben Inspector
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Swamp x19

